  "kinds": [
    "shiori"
  ],
  "origin": "independent",
  "upstream": {
    "url": "https://github.com/opera7133/utatane-modules",
    "author": "opera7133"
  },
  "originalURL": "https://github.com/nikolat/dnproxy",
  "delivery": "binary",
  "license": "MIT",
  "licenseURL": "https://github.com/opera7133/utatane-modules/blob/main/LICENSE",
  "instructions": "docs/dnproxy.md",
  "limitations": [
    "独立実装です。別途.NET 10ランタイムが必要です。実行時コンパイルには.NET 10 SDKも必要です。",
    "Windows APIに依存しないUTF-8のC#・SHIORI/3.0のみ対応します。既存.NET Framework DLLの無変更動作は保証しません。",
    "VB/JScript・WinForms・COM・Windows DLL・dnutil・PLUGIN/SAORI等は未対応です。",
    "Utatane 0.2.20以降は設定ファイルから自動判別し、共通導入版を選べます。0.2.19ではゴースト内への手動配置とshiori.macos指定が必要です。"
  ],
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "revision": 2,
  "abi": "shiori-load-request-unload",
  "minimumOS": "14.0",
  "source": {
    "kind": "local",
    "path": "native"
  },
  "recipe": "recipes/dnproxy/build.sh",
  "requiredFiles": [
    "lib/libdnproxy.dylib",
    "LICENSES/utatane-MIT.txt",
    "README.md",
    "bin/DnProxyHost.dll",
    "bin/DnProxyHost.deps.json",
    "bin/DnProxyHost.runtimeconfig.json",
    "bin/Ukagaka.NET.Interfaces.dll"
  ],
  "windowsFilenames": [
    "dnproxy.dll",
    "dnproxy_debug.dll"
  ]
}
